&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;💰 £60,000 - £64,000 base salary ➕ Incentive Awards tied to your performance ➕ &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;📍This role is based in our London office in Shoreditch (very close to Liverpool Street Station)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;♥️ A collaborative and highly supportive EA team&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;💪The chance to have a genuine impact on how Monzo operates and grows&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;🌱Opportunity to work alongside some of the most senior leaders at Monzo We are unable to sponsor visas for these roles. Only applicants with Right to Work int he UK will be considered 🙏&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⏳ Applications close at 6pm on 3rd September&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;ℹ️ Please Note: We are unable to sponsor visas for these roles. Only applicants with Right to Work in the UK will be considered 🙏&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
