&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/&quot;&gt;BigQuery SQL&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.getdbt.com/&quot;&gt;dbt&lt;/a&gt; for our data modelling and warehousing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PyData stack for model development and offline deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Vertex AI platform for cloud computing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://aws.amazon.com/&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/a&gt; for backend infrastructure
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for ML model microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go lang for most other microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI toolings for productivity (an evolving list)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google suites including access to Gemini&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ChatGPT enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude code&lt;/li&gt;
