&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰£110,000-£150,000 + equity + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core Banking&#39;s mission is to make everyday money magical for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re responsible for the products millions of customers rely on every day — from current accounts, joint accounts and accounts for kids and teens, through to money management, budgeting, and our paid subscriptions. These are some of Monzo&#39;s most loved experiences, and they&#39;re at the heart of how customers interact with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to grow, we&#39;re looking for a Senior User Research Manager to help shape the future of Personal Banking. This is an opportunity to lead research across one of Monzo&#39;s largest product areas, influence company strategy, and develop exceptional research leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for both people leadership and strategic research leadership. This includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading research across Core Banking while helping shape a coherent Personal Banking research strategy that spans multiple product areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with the Core Banking Leadership Team, Product Directors, Design leaders and senior stakeholders across Wealth, Payments, Borrowing and our European business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping define and land parts of Monzo&#39;s global research operating model as we expand internationally, ensuring teams work effectively across both global and local markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connecting customer insights across collectives, identifying themes, opportunities and gaps rather than viewing research through the lens of a single team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing together existing research, product data, market insights and quantitative evidence to help leadership make informed strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing managers and supporting approximately 6-8 direct and indirect reports while maintaining a consistently high bar for research quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating an environment where researchers can balance methodological rigour with the speed needed to build great products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading senior researchers and/or research managers within a complex product organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shaping and influencing product strategy through research at both organisational and executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across multiple product areas, bringing together disparate customer insights into a coherent strategic narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigating complex stakeholder environments where different teams have competing priorities, metrics and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with Product, Design, Engineering and Data Science leaders to influence roadmaps and business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combining qualitative research with quantitative signals, product data and market insights to develop strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building alignment across large organisations and landing new ways of working with multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching research leaders while maintaining a high quality bar across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making thoughtful trade-offs between research depth, pace and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £110,000 - £150,000 ➕ Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We’ll help you relocate to the UK.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor your visa.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter call (30 minutes):&lt;/strong&gt; A conversation with one of our recruiters to learn more about your background, motivations, and what you&#39;re looking for next, while giving you the opportunity to learn more about Monzo and the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Ways of Working (45 minutes):&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll explore your leadership experience, approach to research strategy, and how you raise the research quality bar.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final loop (Total 1hr 30 - 2 hours):&lt;/strong&gt; Two interviews covering &lt;strong&gt;Managing Teams &amp;amp; People&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;, where we&#39;ll discuss your approach to developing research leaders, building high-performing teams, influencing strategy, and driving organisational impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 3-4 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
